Description:
The Boston University Nanotechnology Innovation Center (BUnano) is an interdisciplinary collaborative research center that fosters research and education in nanoscience, nanoengineering, and nanotechnology, addressing challenges in medicine, manufacturing, and energy. The center includes over 60 BU faculty from 10 departments, spanning the College of Engineering, the College of Arts & Sciences, and the School of Medicine. The Center’s mission is to promote a vibrant and dynamic community for nano-related disciplines at BU. Our objectives are to advance research and training in nanoscience and nanotechnology, and to facilitate the translation of scientific discoveries of BU faculty to the market. In partnership with the College of Engineering and BU School of Medicine, BUnano fosters clinician and scientist collaborations through interactions at all stages of research and pre-clinical development. These partnerships expedite the translation of nanotechnology laboratory advances into patient care.

We achieve these objectives by:

•	Providing seed funding for collaborative research and development;
•	Developing large, interdisciplinary grant proposals;
•	Funding graduate students;
•	Organizing targeted workshops and symposia.

To accelerate the development and deployment of nanotechnology innovations that be used to meet key challenges in medicine, energy, and materials science, the Center builds linkages between researchers and technology commercialization resources at BU, including the Photonics Center, the Center for Future Technologies in Cancer Care (CFTCC) the Cancer Research Center, the Evans Center for Interdisciplinary Biomedical Research, the Clinical and Translational Science Institute, and the Fraunhofer Center for Manufacturing Innovations. The BUnano Center also serves as a focal point for interactions with peer universities, Boston-area hospitals, industry, and government to accelerate advances in the field of nanoscience.

Timilon is dedicated to improving lives and environments through safe, effective, and sustainable solutions. Guided by our vision—"Helping individuals and communities create and maintain healthy and safe personal environments where they live, learn, work, play, and assemble"—we're committed to making a positive impact on both personal wellness and the planet.

@EnviroKlenz, one of our pioneering brands, empowers individuals to take control of their environment by removing harmful pollutants and odors, ensuring that the air you breathe is cleaner and safer.

@Fast-Act provides swift, reliable containment and neutralization solutions for Chemical Warfare Agents (CWA), Toxic Industrial Chemicals (TICs), and Toxic Industrial Materials (TIMs). Trusted by the Department of Defense and first responders, Fast-Act transforms spaces into safer, cleaner environments, and contributes to sustainability.

Our commitment to bettering the world goes beyond product creation. At Timilon, we champion a 360-degree approach to sustainability, leveraging clean technology to actively remove harmful chemicals and hazards, thus reducing our environmental footprint.

Join us in our mission to transform the world by eliminating harmful contaminants from the air we breathe, the surfaces we touch, and the environments we live in. Together, with every product, we can create safer, healthier spaces and contribute to a more sustainable future
